OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783684157
OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,FThe Football Association is
OL,8,Fconsidering whether to appeal against
OL,9,FEngland defender Jarell Quansah's red
OL,10,Fcard during the thrilling World Cup
OL,11,Fwin over Mexico.
OL,13,FQuansah was sent off following a VAR
OL,14,Freview of a high tackle on Jesus
OL,15,FGallardo.
OL,17,FThomas Tuchel's side spent much of the
OL,18,Fsecond half down to 10 men at the
OL,19,FEstadio Azteca.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
