OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783684157
OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,FThe FA is weighing up its options
OL,8,Fafter USA star striker Folarin Balogun
OL,9,Fhad a red card overturned following
OL,10,Fintervention by President Donald
OL,11,FTrump, who says he called Fifa
OL,12,FPresident Gianni Infantino about the
OL,13,Fdecision.
OL,15,FTrump was mocked when the co-hosts
OL,16,Fwere knocked out of the tournament in
OL,17,Fa 4-1 defeat to Belgium in Seattle.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783684157
OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,FEngland had to dig deep to secure a
OL,8,Ffamous 3-2 last-16 win against Mexico,
OL,9,Fbut Quansah is due to be suspended for
OL,10,FSaturday's quarter-final against
OL,11,FNorway in Miami.
OL,13,FTuchel was annoyed by the decision and
OL,14,Foverall refereeing standards at the
OL,15,Fcompetition.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783684157
OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,FDespite being sent off against Bosnia-
OL,8,FHerzegovina, Balogun was cleared to
OL,9,Fplay last night after the Fifa
OL,10,FDisciplinary Committee announced it
OL,11,Fwould suspend his one-match ban for a
OL,12,Fyear, leading to widespread criticism
OL,13,Fwithin the game.
OL,15,FPut to Tuchel that might raise hopes
OL,16,Ffor Bayer Leverkusen player Quansah,
OL,17,F23, taking part in the weekend's
OL,18,Fcrucial clash, the Three Lions boss
OL,19,Fsaid: "Where does this start and where
OL,20,Fdoes this end now?
OL,26,@{D@GOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783684157
OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,F"Can we overturn it or not overturn
OL,8,Fit? What's going on? Where to draw the
OL,9,Fline is the question that I ask. I
OL,10,Fhave no answer to that. Where does
OL,11,Fthis end now?
OL,13,F"Do we appeal if a yellow card is not
OL,14,Fa yellow card? Do we think it is not a
OL,15,Fred card or who thinks it?
OL,17,F"Where does this start and where does
OL,18,Fthis end? It's my question. I don't
OL,19,Fhave an answer."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUyD@AOU{D@PO]
