OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,FIn a video on social media, the
OL,8,Fcaptain commented: "Into the next
OL,9,Fround. Incredible night, we appreciate
OL,10,Fthe support, I know we had loads in
OL,11,Fthe stadium and loads watching back
OL,12,Fhome staying up late.
OL,14,F"The connection with everyone is even
OL,15,Fstronger now and we feel that more
OL,16,Fthan ever.
OL,18,F"We recover now, we calm down, we have
OL,19,Fa couple of days relaxing and then
OL,20,Fobviously get prepared for a massive
OL,21,Fquarter-final."
OL,26,@pD@TOUvD@AOUzD@AOU}D@OO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
