OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,FKane, whose second-half penalty proved
OL,8,Fdecisive, said the Azteca experience
OL,9,Fand the nature of the win made it one
OL,10,Fof his favourite games in an England
OL,11,Fshirt.
OL,13,F"Going into that game was so special,
OL,14,Fthe atmosphere, the
OL,15,Fstadium....everyone was so excited to
OL,16,Fbe there and play in this iconic
OL,17,Fgame," he said.
OL,26,@uD@AOUyD@FO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/10
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,316,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F315A1783684157
OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,F"To come through the adversities in
OL,8,Fthe game and battle through the way we
OL,9,Fdid and put our bodies on the line and
OL,10,Fthe boys covering every blade of grass
OL,11,Fwas just incredible to be part of, to
OL,12,Fbe honest.
OL,14,F"It's one of my favourite games in an
OL,15,FEngland shirt, without a doubt. Full
OL,16,Fcredit to all the boys, so proud of
OL,17,Feveryone, all the staff, everyone
OL,18,Finvolved.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
