OL,3,CFA considering appeal over Jarell
OL,4,CQuansah red card in England Mexico
OL,5,Cmatch
OL,7,F"We knew the test we were going into,
OL,8,Fwe knew how tough it would be and we
OL,9,Fcame out on top."
